  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till juridiska fakulteten (FLP) vid Laos nationella universitet, f&#xf6;r 3-&#xe5;rsperioden juli 2000-juni 2003, f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka deras kompetens hos l&#xe4;rare och administration, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra l&#xe4;roplan och undervisnings- metodik, samt uppgradera lokaler, utrustning och studentbost&#xe4;der. SAREC v&#xe4;ntas komplettera st&#xf6;det med satsning p&#xe5; MA-studier o forskning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Faculty of Law and Political Science (FLP) at NUOL, forthe 3-year period July 2000-June 2003, with the objective to help strengthening the competence of their teachers and administration, im-prove curriculum, and upgrade teaching and office premises, equipment and dormitories. SAREC is expected to support MA studies and research.</narrative>
  </description>
